Section 2.3 Edition applicability
Firmware builds numbered 3.1.x implement Edition 3.1. A later edition states
its own build numbering.

Section 5.2 Flow control
A sender shall not have more than 64 frames outstanding. A receiver may close
the session when the unacknowledged window exceeds the value in Table 7.

Table 7 Session limits (Edition 3.1)
row 3  Maximum frame payload ........................ 1024 bytes
row 4  Maximum unacknowledged frame window .......... 64 frames
row 5  Idle session timeout ......................... 30 seconds
